   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "jonathan",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 14,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 869,
   "inicio": "I thought never to write in this diary again, but the"
  },
  {
   "dia": 26,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 14,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 4220,
   "inicio": "Truly there is no such thing as finality. Not a week"
  },
  {
   "dia": 27,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 15,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 1466,
   "inicio": "It was two o’clock before we found a suitable"
  },
  {
   "dia": 27,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 15,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 378,
   "inicio": "Friend John,--"
  },
  {
   "dia": 28,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 15,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 152,
   "inicio": "It is wonderful what a good night’s sleep will do for"
  },
  {
   "dia": 29,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 15,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 3824,
   "inicio": "Arthur and Quincey came into Van Helsing’s room; he told us all that he"
  },
  {
   "dia": 29,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 16,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 2833,
   "inicio": "A little before twelve o’clock we three--Arthur,"
  },
  {
   "dia": 29,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "mina",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 17,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 845,
   "inicio": "After I had tidied myself, I went down to Dr. Seward’s"
  },
