   "dia": 29,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 17,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 598,
   "inicio": "I was so absorbed in that wonderful diary of Jonathan"
  },
  {
   "dia": 29,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "mina",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 17,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 566,
   "inicio": "After dinner I came with Dr. Seward to his study. He"
  },
  {
   "dia": 30,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 17,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 603,
   "inicio": "Mr. Harker arrived at nine o’clock. He had got his"
  },
  {
   "dia": 29,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "jonathan",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 17,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 461,
   "inicio": "When I received Mr. Billington’s"
  },
  {
   "dia": 30,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "jonathan",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 17,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 479,
   "inicio": "The station-master was good enough to give me a line to"
  },
  {
   "dia": 30,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "mina",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 17,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 1459,
   "inicio": "I am so glad that I hardly know how to contain myself."
  },
  {
   "dia": 30,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 18,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 1884,
   "inicio": "I got home at five o’clock, and found that Godalming"
  },
  {
   "dia": 30,
   "mes": 9,
   "autor": "mina",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 18,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 3070,
   "inicio": "When we met in Dr. Seward’s study two hours after"
  },
