   "mes": 10,
   "autor": "mina",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 19,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 1463,
   "inicio": "It is strange to me to be kept in the dark as I am to-day;"
  },
  {
   "dia": 2,
   "mes": 10,
   "autor": "mina",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 19,
   "lugar": "m",
   "palabras": 329,
   "inicio": "Last night I slept, but did not dream. I must have"
  },
  {
   "dia": 1,
   "mes": 10,
   "autor": "jonathan",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 20,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 814,
   "inicio": "I found Thomas Snelling in his house at Bethnal"
  },
  {
   "dia": 2,
   "mes": 10,
   "autor": "jonathan",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 20,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 2502,
   "inicio": "A long and trying and exciting day. By the first"
  },
  {
   "dia": 1,
   "mes": 10,
   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 20,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 2110,
   "inicio": "I am puzzled afresh about Renfield. His moods change so"
  },
  {
   "dia": 2,
   "mes": 10,
   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 20,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 510,
   "inicio": "I placed a man in the corridor last night, and told him to"
  },
  {
   "dia": 3,
   "mes": 10,
   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 21,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 6228,
   "inicio": "Let me put down with exactness all that happened, as well"
  },
