   "autor": "seward",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 24,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 1502,
   "inicio": "We all rose early, and I think that sleep did much for"
  },
  {
   "dia": 5,
   "mes": 10,
   "autor": "jonathan",
   "tipo": "diario",
   "capitulo": 24,
   "lugar": "",
   "palabras": 550,
   "inicio": "For some time after our meeting this morning I"
  },
  {
